--- !u!114 &277250232
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 277250231}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 45df30574d13c7b41b77e9b972b2b417, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WaveRadioSystem
  waveBroadcastList:
  - waveNumber: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    displayDuration: 1
    messages:
    - '"Good afternoon, dear listeners. Welcome to the main news bulletin."'
    - '"We begin our broadcast with breaking news from the world of science."'
    - '"Seismologists and geophysicists have detected highly unusual, previously
      unseen activity in the Earth''s core."'
    - '"Experts have yet to determine the cause of this anomaly, which is unprecedented
      in human history."'
    - '"The scientific board advises all citizens to remain vigilant and take precautions
      against all possibilities over the next few days."'
    - '"We will continue to keep you updated on the developments."'
  - waveNumber: 2
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    displayDuration: 1
    messages:
    - '"Unfortunately, today we continue our bulletin with those alarming movements
      taking place in the core."'
    - '"The latest measurements from yesterday indicate that these movements are
      not random and that their impact will continue to grow."'
    - '"Experts are issuing severe warnings that this situation could trigger major
      earthquakes very soon!"'
    - '"Please check the items in your home right now: Ensure that your cabinets
      are secured to the walls, that your stove is completely turned off, and also
      check for any electrical lea..."'
    - '"Wait a minute! Dear listeners, a major breaking news update has just reached
      our studio!"'
    - '"Yes, it is currently being confirmed by the center: A moderate earthquake
      wave will strike in just a few minutes!"'
    - '"All citizens must immediately move to safe areas, be prepared!"'
  - waveNumber: 3
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    displayDuration: 1
    messages:
    - '"We extend our heartfelt well wishes to all citizens affected by yesterday''s
      tremors and accidents."'
    - '"Unfortunately, according to scientists, yesterday''s events are not the end;
      they are said to be a precursor to a much larger mainshock."'
    - '"The most important and necessary action we can take right now is to fully
      ensure our indoor safety."'
    - '"Furthermore, recent tests and psychological studies show that individuals
      who panic during an earthquake are much more prone to making poor decisions."'
    - '"Please keep your stress levels under control. To help with this, you can
      turn off any devices or sounds in your environment that cause you discomfort
      or panic."'
    - '"Oh no! The seismic sensors are sounding the alarm again! Another earthquake
      wave is incoming, and this time it is said to be much larger!"'
    - '"Please do not panic; take the drop, cover, and hold on position!!"'
  - waveNumber: 4
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    displayDuration: 1
    messages:
    - '"Following these relentless major disasters, we once again extend our heartfelt
      well wishes to all our citizens..."'
    - '"And now, we move on to the most critical announcement."'
    - '"According to the latest reports from the scientific board, the final and
      largest earthquake, caused by the rupture in the core, is expected today."'
    - '"Therefore, prepare yourselves and your surroundings thoroughly until the
      very last moment."'
    - '"Check your circuit breakers and wiring for electrical leaks, and establish
      a safe triangle of life area for yourselves."'
    - '"We wish all our citizens the best of luck... May God help us all. Brace yourselves,
      here it comes!"'
  radioPanel: {fileID: 541169701}
  radioText: {fileID: 541169700}
